{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02027",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.11,
      "end_seconds": 3.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "right then, come on in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.36,
      "end_seconds": 7.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "ah, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.49,
      "end_seconds": 10.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Weather's turned, hasn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.7,
      "end_seconds": 17.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Erm, it has. I got caught in the rain walking over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.35,
      "end_seconds": 21.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "what do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.4,
      "end_seconds": 36.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.5,
      "text": "I'm, I'm here because of a bump on the head. I did try to ignore it for a while. My sister suggested writing things down, you know, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.18,
      "end_seconds": 41.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.11,
      "end_seconds": 47.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Um, you know, it's been two days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.94,
      "end_seconds": 53.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.59,
      "end_seconds": 77.93,
      "duration_seconds": 22.34,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. No, I share a house with my brother. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.38,
      "end_seconds": 91.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.91,
      "end_seconds": 97.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.74,
      "end_seconds": 104.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.93,
      "end_seconds": 115.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "I had a reaction to erythromycin when I was younger, bad stomach cramps, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.23,
      "end_seconds": 119.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.77,
      "end_seconds": 127.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.64,
      "end_seconds": 148.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.55,
      "end_seconds": 152.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.63,
      "end_seconds": 155.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "How about vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.97,
      "end_seconds": 158.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "no, none, no vomiting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.72,
      "end_seconds": 164.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Did you get fit, loss of consciousness or drowsiness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.17,
      "end_seconds": 167.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.87,
      "end_seconds": 174.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.17,
      "end_seconds": 179.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "erm, no, my breathing's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.87,
      "end_seconds": 193.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.38,
      "end_seconds": 207.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.16,
      "end_seconds": 232.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse is 75 beats a minute, BP is 127 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.43,
      "end_seconds": 236.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.57,
      "end_seconds": 240.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.43,
      "end_seconds": 261.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "there is a small lump on the forehead, he is alert, and his pupils and movements are normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.17,
      "end_seconds": 275.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.22,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards a minor head bump with no worrying signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.12,
      "end_seconds": 279.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.82,
      "end_seconds": 289.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.43,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like a minor head bump with no worrying signs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.91,
      "end_seconds": 314.68,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "Watch him for the next twenty-four hours and give paracetamol if he is sore. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.12,
      "end_seconds": 318.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Uh, thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.06,
      "end_seconds": 321.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
}